---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Austria Atmosphere"
  description="Growing the open web in Austria. Join our meetups or ping us for event visibility."
>
  <main>
    <h1>Austria Atmosphere</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Spreading the holy word of the open web.</p>

    <div class="content">
      <p>
        We are a community in Austria. We want to grow the open web. We believe
        in open standards and decentralization.
      </p>

      <p>
        We build around the AT Protocol. It is a new technology for social
        networks. It powers applications like Bluesky. It gives users true
        ownership over their data. It allows different platforms to communicate
        directly.
      </p>

      <p>
        We organize meetups. We sometimes gather in Vienna. We encourage people
        to host gatherings everywhere in Austria.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can host your own event. Just ping us if you need visibility. We
        will create an event page for you on{" "}
        <a
          href="https://atmo.rsvp/p/austria-atmosphe.re"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          atmo.rsvp
        </a>
        .
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav>
      <a
        href="https://atproto.com/guides/faq"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        What is AT Protocol?
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://mu.social/profile/austria-atmosphe.re"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        mu.social
      </a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
    animation: fade-in 1.5s ease-out;
    text-align: left;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-family: "Fraenkisch", serif;
    color: var(--text-color);
  }
  .content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  @keyframes fade-in {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
